c=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070560/extras/3a1edd7148c68c0c67a4d3a363c093c1.avif?t=1755276651\" width=617 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dialogue System:</strong> Key phrases will be highlighted during each acquisition phase in conversations. Clicking on these phrases presents options such as using procured tools and gathered information. The outcome of recruiting these women for the slum\u2019s community depends on your assistance with Aid's ability to exploit their unwittingly revealed vulnerabilities with the right choice.<br></li><li><strong>Recruitment System:</strong> Recruits will be appearing in different roles\u2014from being combatants for entertainment or defending against threats to working in the local inn or contributing to various community activities within the slum.<br></li><li><strong>Battle System:</strong> Assist recruits in battles against enemies and in the arena, leveraging their skills and abilities gained through battles or upgrading their weapons in the weapons shop.<br></li><li><strong>Character Scenes:</strong> Experience unique character scenes enriching the narrative and depth of interaction with the girls.<br></li><li><strong>Recollection Mode:</strong> View unlocked character scenes and revisit special moments within the game's recollection mode</li></ul>",
